      <title>PETA advocates for the retirement of Butler’s live mascot program</title>
      <link>https://thebutlercollegian.com/2026/03/peta-advocates-for-the-retirement-of-butlers-live-mascot-program/</link>
      <description>Following the retirement announcement of Butler Blue IV to prioritize his health, People for the Ethical Treatment of Animals (PETA) sent a letter to President James Danko encouraging the university to fully retire its live bulldog mascot program. The letter proposes a new mascot — The Butler Bullfrogs — and offers to pay for a new bullfrog mascot costume. In a press […]</description>
